<title>HONG KONG: HK's Soundwill debuts at HK$2.90/share.</title>
<headline>HK's Soundwill debuts at HK$2.90/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of property redevelopment firm Soundwill Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.90 per share on Friday compared with an issue price of HK$2.18 each.</p>
</text>
